# Deathless Pilot: "This creature saddles Mounts ... as though its power were 2 greater" (CR 702.171c), so its 2 power
# counts as 4. Caustic Bronco has Saddle 3: Isamaru (power 2) cannot saddle it alone (the refusal). Once the Pilot is cast
# the Pilot alone can, and the Bronco is saddled. Black Lotus pays the Bronco; Mox Jet and Mox Ruby the Pilot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Caustic Bronco
Deathless Pilot
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Caustic Bronco.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Caustic Bronco.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deathless Pilot.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Caustic Bronco.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Deathless Pilot)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Caustic Bronco.Saddled = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Deathless Pilot.Tapped = True
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Tapped = False
